@startuml getForwardingConstructForTheForwardingNameAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getForwardingConstructForTheForwardingNameAsync – Retrieve Forwarding-Construct by ForwardingName
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "ForwardingDomain" as fdRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  :
  - forwardingName
end note

requestor -> fdRes: (forwardingName)
activate fdRes

fdRes -> jd: read forwarding-domain list
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct
jd --> fdRes: list of forwarding-constructs
deactivate jd

note over fdRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through forwarding-constructs
  - For each forwarding-construct, check value-name "ForwardingName"
  - Collect forwarding-constructs whose value matches input forwardingName
  - Return array of matching forwarding-construct(s)
  - Return empty array if no match exists
end note

fdRes --> requestor: Array of forwardingConstruct objects | []
deactivate fdRes

@enduml
